repository-code: "https://github.com/ZeraBooks/iolta-three-way-reconciliation"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: "A three-way reconciliation shows that three records of client trust money agree on one date: the trust bank statement (adjusted for deposits in transit and outstanding checks), the firm's trust journal, and the total of the client ledgers. This repo has a template, a fictional law firm's June with four client matters, and a script that does the three-way check and flags any client ledger that goes below zero."
keywords:
  - iolta
  - trust-accounting
  - three-way-reconciliation
  - law-firm
  - bookkeeping
  - reconciliation
